This abstract property returns the class name of the concrete object, 
which is useful for debugging purpose.

**Attention:**
	For derivations: **It is necessary that this property is overridden by the concrete class**

.. <legal notes>

legal notes
=================
| SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2022 ekvip automation GmbH <info@ekvip.de>
| SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
| For details check: Apache-2.0_

.. _Apache-2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

.. </legal notes>

*)

PROPERTY ABSTRACT className :ClassName
]]></Declaration>
      <Get Name="Get" Id="{9b8bc827-1a36-429b-ace3-5822d1173278}">
        <Declaration><![CDATA[
]]></Declaration>
        <Implementation>
